  "goodToKnow": "Der Schwachsinn means nonsense or rubbish in casual speech: Das ist totaler Schwachsinn! It's blunt and a bit rude, so with colleagues use Unsinn or Quatsch instead. Originally, Schwachsinn was a medical term for intellectual disability, which is why it can sound offensive. Schwachsinnig means idiotic. Literally: weak (schwach) mind or sense (der Sinn). Similar: der Blödsinn."
